WEBVTT

00:10:29.897 --> 00:10:32.530
and grief is all around us.

00:10:33.163 --> 00:10:37.397
Unfortunately, I don't think we're always
very good at grappling with loss

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:39.263
or talking about death,

00:10:39.263 --> 00:10:42.997
or talking about the way that our history
is still living in the present.

00:10:44.363 --> 00:10:46.163
Ghost stories can be scary,

00:10:46.163 --> 00:10:50.730
but so is being vulnerable,
so is any unknown.

00:10:51.863 --> 00:10:53.363
So the next time

00:10:53.363 --> 00:10:55.430
you're trying to figure out
a way to connect

00:10:55.463 --> 00:10:57.797
and you’re not sure what to do,
let me offer this.

00:10:58.230 --> 00:11:00.997
Try asking someone for a ghost story.